            "kind": "IDEA",
            "text": "Problem: minor league free agency each November releases many upper-minors players, and evaluation is often cursory. Owner: pro scouting director and farm director. Decision: minor league free agent signings and spring invites every offseason. Mechanism: coverage of a neglected population, plus speed. Intervention: a prebuilt eligible-player list from public service-time and transaction data, ranked by public Triple-A and Double-A tracking metrics where available, with a one-page profile per player.",
