        "details": {
          "objective": "Challenge this selected opportunity and its experiment design (evidence id design-v1) using the measured feasibility facts (evidence id s1-feasibility). Attack: whether the November pool decision really changes with a ranking; whether the outcome definition (>=50 MLB PA or >=20 IP next season) measures value or mostly opportunity; leakage or hindsight in features, splits or outcome; fairness and strength of baselines B0/B1; whether k=50 and the +3 hits threshold are justified; base-rate and sample-size risk; what existing public tools already do this; and above all: what would make this project LOOK useful while actually providing little or no baseball advantage. Use ASSUMPTION lines for challenges, UNKNOWN for missing evidence, CITE for supplied evidence ids, and IDEA only for a concrete design correction.",
